&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who We Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Konrad is a next-generation digital consultancy that solves complex business problems for global clients with creative, forward-thinking solutions. We&#39;re passionate about innovation and about building best-in-class digital and AI-enabled products.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Konrad is looking for a Consultant to join our Management Consulting team. You&#39;ll work with colleagues to deliver digital and AI projects, and guide clients through design thinking to create cutting-edge experiences. We use modern digital and AI tools in our own work and help clients use them to transform their businesses.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Support senior team members on projects ranging from rapid-to-market initiatives to large-scale digital and AI transformations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Create digital and AI-enabled solutions for clients across a range of industries&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Lead and take part in UX design thinking workshops, including finding opportunities where digital and AI can add value&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Interpret client business challenges and work with design and technology teams to solve them&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Conduct interviews and research on client processes and competitive positioning, using digital and AI tools to speed up research and synthesis&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Manage project coordination&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Stay current on digital, technology and AI trends, and share insights with the team and clients&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Develop presentations, documentation and proposal responses&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; 2+ years of relevant experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; A background in strategy, design and/or technology engagements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; A demonstrated passion for UX, digital design and technology&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Comfort using AI tools in your day-to-day work, with good judgment about where they add value&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; A strong track record of client collaboration&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Interest in emerging technologies and how digital and AI are changing customer experiences&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; An appreciation for quality digital design&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Excellent written and verbal communication&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Strong analytical and problem-solving skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Self-motivation and a collaborative approach&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Comfort presenting and public speaking&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Perks and Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Comprehensive Health &amp;amp; Wellness Benefits Package&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Socials, Outings &amp;amp; Retreats&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Retirement Planning&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Parental Leave Program&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Culture of Learning &amp;amp; Development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Flexible Working Hours&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Work from Home Flexibility&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Service Recognition Programs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Konrad is committed to maintaining a diverse work environment and is proud to be an equal opportunity employer. All qualified applicants, regardless of race, colour, religion, gender, gender identity or expression, sexual orientation, national origin, genetics, disability, age, or veteran status will receive consideration for employment. If you have any accessibility requirements or concerns regarding the hiring process or employment with us, please notify us so we can provide suitable accommodation.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The estimated compensation for this position is $78,000 to $90,000. This is an estimate and a compensation offer will vary based on applicant&#39;s education, experience, skills, abilities and alignment with market data.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;While we sincerely appreciate all applications, only those candidates selected for an interview will be contacted.&lt;/p&gt;
